{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"76828db413bd4fc7964dcc06a194aed5","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"b2a445cca7213a4532a9543acf675324d34f","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=b2a445cca7213a4532a9543acf675324d34f","view_num":1032,"pub_timestamp":"1709546100","title":"3월 7일 업데이트 공지(3/8 내용 추가)","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=b2a445cca7213a4532a9543acf675324d34f","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"7a65db480982bdc8760078949d7e5efe\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"d7bcefb25cda452f33f47cb39c4a9eef\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e존경하는\u0026nbsp;지휘관님,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e오래\u0026nbsp;기다려\u0026nbsp;주셔서\u0026nbsp;진심으로\u0026nbsp;감사드립니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검이\u0026nbsp;완료되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;보상은\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;메일함에서\u0026nbsp;확인해\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이번\u0026nbsp;업데이트는\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;클라이언트가\u0026nbsp;업데이트되어\u0026nbsp;스토어에서\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;버전\u0026nbsp;클라이언트를\u0026nbsp;새로\u0026nbsp;다운로드하셔야만\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;다운로드를\u0026nbsp;위해,\u0026nbsp;디바이스의\u0026nbsp;저장\u0026nbsp;공간은\u0026nbsp;최소\u0026nbsp;5GB\u0026nbsp;이상\u0026nbsp;확보해\u0026nbsp;주시기를\u0026nbsp;권장드립니다.\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전의\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;Launcher에서\u0026nbsp;[게임\u0026nbsp;시작]\u0026nbsp;버튼을\u0026nbsp;터치하면\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;클라이언트로\u0026nbsp;업데이트가\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[리소스\u0026nbsp;파일\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;과정에서\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하는\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;리소스\u0026nbsp;다운로드에\u0026nbsp;실패할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있사오니,\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하지\u0026nbsp;말아\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드,\u0026nbsp;에이드,\u0026nbsp;일레그,\u0026nbsp;목단은\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼),\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e업데이트\u0026nbsp;주요\u0026nbsp;내용:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.1\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[D\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e상냥하고\u0026nbsp;순종적인\u0026nbsp;부인을\u0026nbsp;연기하는\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[D\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프]가\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집에\u0026nbsp;합류합니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003eD\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프는\u0026nbsp;관통에\u0026nbsp;특화된\u0026nbsp;스나이퍼\u0026nbsp;라이플을\u0026nbsp;사용하는\u0026nbsp;아군들의\u0026nbsp;공격\u0026nbsp;능력을\u0026nbsp;향상할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;니케입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;사격\u0026nbsp;부위에\u0026nbsp;따른\u0026nbsp;별도의\u0026nbsp;버프를\u0026nbsp;아군에게\u0026nbsp;제공해,\u0026nbsp;공격\u0026nbsp;능력을\u0026nbsp;더욱\u0026nbsp;끌어올립니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;클래스:\u0026nbsp;지원형\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;무기:\u0026nbsp;히든\u0026nbsp;엣지(SR)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;코드:\u0026nbsp;작열\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;기업:\u0026nbsp;엘리시온\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*획득처:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;대원\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*모집\u0026nbsp;안내:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①쥬얼(무료/유료)\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓으로\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집을\u0026nbsp;진행할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(일반\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e②특수\u0026nbsp;모집의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;4%이며,\u0026nbsp;그중\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;[D\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프]의\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;2%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e③특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e④200개의\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;모아\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;[D\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프]를\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e⑤특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;사용하지\u0026nbsp;않은\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;소멸되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e⑥특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;[D\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프]는\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e1.2\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장에서\u0026nbsp;현재\u0026nbsp;픽업\u0026nbsp;중인\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;스쿼드에\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류하여\u0026nbsp;체험하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;가능\u0026nbsp;기간:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[D\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;킬러\u0026nbsp;와이프]:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.1\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;KILL\u0026nbsp;THE\u0026nbsp;LORD\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e고위층들의\u0026nbsp;모임에\u0026nbsp;참여하는\u0026nbsp;이들이\u0026nbsp;차례차례\u0026nbsp;실종되는\u0026nbsp;사건이\u0026nbsp;발생한다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e사건의\u0026nbsp;진상을\u0026nbsp;조사하기\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;D와\u0026nbsp;지휘관은\u0026nbsp;모임에\u0026nbsp;참여하기로\u0026nbsp;하지만,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e그\u0026nbsp;모임은\u0026nbsp;부부동반이라는\u0026nbsp;조건이\u0026nbsp;걸려\u0026nbsp;있었다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003eD와\u0026nbsp;지휘관은\u0026nbsp;모임에\u0026nbsp;잠입하기\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;신혼부부를\u0026nbsp;연기하게\u0026nbsp;되는데….\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003eKILL\u0026nbsp;THE\u0026nbsp;LORD\u0026nbsp;이벤트에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;획득하고\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;다양한\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점의\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;교환은\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;종료됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e[챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지]가\u0026nbsp;KILL\u0026nbsp;THE\u0026nbsp;LORD에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;고난이도의\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;스테이지에\u0026nbsp;도전하여\u0026nbsp;각종\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득해\u0026nbsp;보세요!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.2\u0026nbsp;7\u0026nbsp;Days\u0026nbsp;Login\u0026nbsp;이벤트-FAIR\u0026nbsp;JUDGE\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;매일\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하여\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;7일까지\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;로그인\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료가\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;모든\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.3\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;School\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;Lock\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;School\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;Lock이\u0026nbsp;아카이브에\u0026nbsp;추가됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;KILL\u0026nbsp;THE\u0026nbsp;LORD에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트를\u0026nbsp;해금할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;[메모리\u0026nbsp;필름]을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;전초기지\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2.4\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e주말\u0026nbsp;FULL\u0026nbsp;BURST\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;9일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;11일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;16일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;18일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e주말\u0026nbsp;FULL\u0026nbsp;BURST\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;요격전\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸에서의\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;한\u0026nbsp;번\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3.1\u0026nbsp;트라이브\u0026nbsp;타워\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;상한\u0026nbsp;조정\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e트라이브\u0026nbsp;타워의\u0026nbsp;스테이지가\u0026nbsp;450층에서\u0026nbsp;550층으로\u0026nbsp;상향\u0026nbsp;조정됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e기업\u0026nbsp;타워의\u0026nbsp;스테이지가\u0026nbsp;400층에서\u0026nbsp;500층으로\u0026nbsp;상향\u0026nbsp;조정됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드가\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e솔로\u0026nbsp;단위로\u0026nbsp;여러개의\u0026nbsp;파티를\u0026nbsp;사용하여\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;도전하고\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;큐브\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;도전\u0026nbsp;난이도에선\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;높은\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;피해량을\u0026nbsp;보유한\u0026nbsp;기준으로\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;순위를\u0026nbsp;정하고,\u0026nbsp;랭킹에\u0026nbsp;따라\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;프레임,\u0026nbsp;쥬얼을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;15일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e지휘관\u0026nbsp;5명이\u0026nbsp;협동하여\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e알트아이젠\u0026nbsp;[P.S.I.D.]]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e에\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;도전합니다.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전은\u0026nbsp;친구나\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버\u0026nbsp;혹은\u0026nbsp;자동\u0026nbsp;매칭을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;도전이\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;처치하여\u0026nbsp;획득한\u0026nbsp;부서진\u0026nbsp;코어는\u0026nbsp;고철\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;쥬얼,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;10일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;참여\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;아레나\u0026nbsp;그룹\u0026nbsp;재정렬\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e루키\u0026nbsp;아레나와\u0026nbsp;스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나에서\u0026nbsp;주기적으로\u0026nbsp;그룹\u0026nbsp;재정렬이\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*재정렬\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①루키\u0026nbsp;아레나:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;21일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e②스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;27일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;28일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;기능\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.1\u0026nbsp;프로필에\u0026nbsp;테두리\u0026nbsp;전시\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*프로필에서\u0026nbsp;획득한\u0026nbsp;테두리를\u0026nbsp;전시하도록\u0026nbsp;설정할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.2\u0026nbsp;필드에서\u0026nbsp;유실물을\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;쉽게\u0026nbsp;찾을\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;탐색\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.3\u0026nbsp;복귀\u0026nbsp;유저들에게\u0026nbsp;제공되었던\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;니케들을\u0026nbsp;모든\u0026nbsp;유저가\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;범위를\u0026nbsp;확장하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.4\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전에\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;투표\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;투표가\u0026nbsp;시작된\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;5초\u0026nbsp;이내에\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;많은\u0026nbsp;투표를\u0026nbsp;받은\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;사용됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;각\u0026nbsp;스킬의\u0026nbsp;득표수가\u0026nbsp;같을\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;상단에\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;사용됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;투표에\u0026nbsp;참여한\u0026nbsp;인원의\u0026nbsp;과반수\u0026nbsp;이상으로부터\u0026nbsp;득표한\u0026nbsp;스킬은\u0026nbsp;즉시\u0026nbsp;사용됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;투표가\u0026nbsp;초기화될\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있으며,\u0026nbsp;이\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;재투표가\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.5\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;꾸미기에\u0026nbsp;검색\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;꾸미기에서\u0026nbsp;‘스탠딩’과\u0026nbsp;‘스킬\u0026nbsp;컷씬’을\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;이름으로\u0026nbsp;검색하는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e7.6\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;유실물\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;사용성을\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e8.1\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;패키지가\u0026nbsp;갱신됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e*판매\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;～\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;20일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e상세한\u0026nbsp;정보는\u0026nbsp;[로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;패키지]에서\u0026nbsp;확인하여\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;개선\u0026nbsp;사항\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;기타\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.1\u0026nbsp;전초기지가\u0026nbsp;봄\u0026nbsp;테마로\u0026nbsp;변경되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.2\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e대한민국\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전\u0026nbsp;[보호자\u0026nbsp;제어]\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;대한민국\u0026nbsp;「게임산업진흥에\u0026nbsp;관한\u0026nbsp;법률」의\u0026nbsp;규정에\u0026nbsp;따라\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전에서\u0026nbsp;[국가/지역을\u0026nbsp;대한민국으로\u0026nbsp;선택]하신\u0026nbsp;미성년\u0026nbsp;이용자의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;법정\u0026nbsp;대리인이\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;로비에서\u0026nbsp;[보호자\u0026nbsp;제어]\u0026nbsp;기능을\u0026nbsp;활성화해\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;이용\u0026nbsp;방법과\u0026nbsp;이용\u0026nbsp;시간을\u0026nbsp;설정,\u0026nbsp;제한할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;알려진\u0026nbsp;이슈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e①\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;환경에서\u0026nbsp;화면이\u0026nbsp;세로\u0026nbsp;모드인\u0026nbsp;상태로\u0026nbsp;[계정\u0026nbsp;관리]\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;진입할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;화면이\u0026nbsp;잘려보이는\u0026nbsp;현상이\u0026nbsp;확인되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└게임\u0026nbsp;재실행\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;화면을\u0026nbsp;가로\u0026nbsp;모드로\u0026nbsp;변경할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;계정\u0026nbsp;관리\u0026nbsp;메뉴를\u0026nbsp;이용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└해당 현상은 원인이 파악되어 이후 패치를 통해 수정될 예정입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e②\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;EX-05\u0026nbsp;섹터를\u0026nbsp;정상적으로\u0026nbsp;진행하지\u0026nbsp;못하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e└해당\u0026nbsp;현상은\u0026nbsp;원인이\u0026nbsp;파악되어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;패치를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;수정될\u0026nbsp;예정입니다.\u0026nbsp;(3월\u0026nbsp;8일\u0026nbsp;공지\u0026nbsp;수정)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e9.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e기타\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선\u0026nbsp;상황\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;버그\u0026nbsp;복구\u0026nbsp;상황은\u0026nbsp;시스템\u0026nbsp;공지\u0026nbsp;[3월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;개선사항]에서\u0026nbsp;안내하여\u0026nbsp;드리겠습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e감사합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e《승리의\u0026nbsp;여신:\u0026nbsp;니케》\u0026nbsp;운영진\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_086b372f9743b1e3f5eca223dee318648197c267-1920x1080-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.jpeg"],"ext_info":"{\"template_id\":\"\"}","jump_link":{},"content_desc":"3월 7일 업데이트 공지(3/8 내용 추가)","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"존경하는 지휘관님,\n \n오래 기다려 주셔서 진심으로 감사드립니다. 서버 점검이 완료되었습니다. 서버 점검 보상은 게임 내 메일함에서 확인해 주시기 바랍니다. \n \n이번 업데이트는 게임 클라이언트가 업데이트되어 스토어에서 최신 버전 클라이언트를 새로 다운로드하셔야만 게임에 접속하실 수 있습니다. 신규 클라이언트 다운로드를 위해, 디바이스의 저장 공간은 최소 5GB 이상 확보해 주시기를 권장드립니다. PC 버전의 경우, Launcher에서 [게임 시작] 버튼을 터치하면 최신 클라이언트로 업데이트가 진행됩니다.\n[리소스 파일 다운로드 과정에서 게임 앱을 강제 종료하는 경우 클라이언트 리소스 다운로드에 실패할 수 있사오니, 다운로드 중엔 게임 앱을 강제 종료하지 말아 주시기 바랍니다.]\n \n프리바티 : 언카인드 메이드, 에이드, 일레그, 목단은 일반 모집, 소셜 포인트 모집, 몰드 아이템을 통해 모집 가능합니다. (신규 지휘관 전용 모집, 일반 모집(튜토리얼), 마일리지 상점에서 획득하실 ","language":"ko","father_content_id":"b2a445cca7213a4532a9543acf675324d34f","result":0}}